 "text": "..title\nA resolution to amend Ordinance No. BL2025-1141, as amended, to authorize The Metropolitan Government of Nashville and Davidson County to accept additional public sanitary sewer manhole, for two properties located at 3533 B Dickerson Pike and 550 Dusky Drive, also known as Artist Lofts – Revision 2 (MWS Project No. 24-SL-242 and Proposal No. 2025M-168ES-003).\n..body\nWHEREAS, Ordinance No. BL2025-1141, approved December 17, 2025, and amended by Resolution No. RS2026-1948, approved May 8, 2026, authorized the acceptance of approximately 382 linear feet of new eight-inch sanitary sewer main (PVC), six sanitary sewer manholes and easements, for two properties located at 3533 B Dickerson Pike and 550 Dusky Drive, also known as Artist Lofts – Revision 1; and,\nWHEREAS, the acceptance of one additional new sanitary sewer manhole, is needed to construct Project No. 24-SL-242; and, \nWHEREAS, the Metropolitan Planning Commission approved mandatory referral No. 2025M168ES-003 on August 5, 2026, for revisions to the previous mandatory referral; and,\nWHEREAS, Ordinance No. BL2025-1141 provides that amendments to the legislation shall be approved by resolution.\nNOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE COUNCIL OF THE METROPOLITAN GOVERNMENT OF NASHVILLE AND DAVIDSON COUNTY:\nSection 1.\tThat Ordinance No. BL2025-1141 is hereby amended by deleting Section 1 in its entirety and replacing it with the following:\nThe Metropolitan Government of Nashville and Davidson County is authorized to accept approximately 382 linear feet of new eight-inch sanitary sewer main (PVC), seven sanitary sewer manholes and easements, for two properties located at 3533 B Dickerson Pike and 550 Dusky Drive, also known as Artist Lofts – Revision 2, as shown below and on Exhibit 1, which is attached hereto and incorporated by reference:\nMap & Parcel:\t\t\t\t\tAddress:\n050040A90000CO\t\t\t\t3533 B Dickerson Pike\n05000017600\t\t\t\t\t550 Dusky Drive\nSection 2.\tThe Directors of Water and Sewerage Services and Public Property Administration are authorized to execute such documents as may be necessary and appropriate to carry out the acceptance authorized by this resolution. \nSection 3. This resolution shall take effect upon passage, the welfare of The Metropolitan Government of Nashville and Davidson County requiring it.\n..Agenda Analysis\nAnalysis\n\nThis resolution amends Ordinance No. BL2025-1141, which was approved by the Metropolitan Council on September 2, 2025 and amended by Resolution No. RS2026-1948 on May 8, 2026. The ordinance accepted of approximately 382 linear feet of new eight-inch sanitary sewer main (PVC), six sanitary sewer manholes and easements, for two properties located at 3533 B Dickerson Pike and 550 Dusky Drive.\n\nThe proposed resolution would amend BL2026-1141 to accept one additional new sanitary sewer manhole.\n\nThis amendment has been approved by the Planning Commission. BL2025-1141 may be amended by resolution of the Metropolitan Council.\n\n"
